1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,440
April 25th, 1915, dawn.

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:05,080
Thousands of soldiers

3
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,270
land at Ariburnu.

4
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:07,490
If the heights fall,

5
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:08,750
Gallipoli could fall.

6
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:09,730
Lieutenant Colonel

7
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:11,090
Mustafa Kemal has one

8
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:12,950
regiment: the 57th.

9
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:14,380
But no order has come

10
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:15,010
from above.

11
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:16,170
What would you do?

12
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:18,540
A: I wait for orders.

13
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:20,460
B: I take the regiment

14
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:21,270
up the hill without

15
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,070
waiting.
